  "details": "It'd be neat if there was a Local Only Toggle for the Audio state behavior script, similar to the one found on the Parameter Driver script. \n\nBasically, if toggled, only run the script and play the sound for the local client wearing the avatar.  I sometimes like to do local UX shenanigans in menus and if there was a toggle I wouldn't need a separate branch for remote/local when I want to simply play a sound only for the local user.\n\nSimilarly, the reverse of this as \"Remote Only\" could also potentially be useful.",
